television series The Girls Next Door.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
The film is also the producing debut of Bridget Marquardt, who
teamed up with veteran producer Chuck Williams.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
It is directed by Jeff Burr and first time director Nicholas
Carpenter, grandson of filmmaker Hal Roach.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
The making of the film was featured on the popular
reality show The Girls Next Door.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
The majority of the filming took place at the
Playboy Mansion and the Hollywood Castle.

18
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
In addition to Madison and Marquardt, Playboy Playmate of the Year
Sara Jean Underwood makes an appearance in the film.

19
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
The film explores themes of poison, undead, murder, sorority, pledge.

20
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The tone is dark and intense.
